  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　あたえると\nつかまえた　ときに　どうぐが\nてにはいり　やすくなる　きのみ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 주면\n잡았을 때 도구를 손에 넣기\n쉬워지는 나무열매.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "把這個樹果餵給寶可夢，\n在捕捉成功後，\n會更容易獲得道具。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Baie à donner à un Pokémon sauvage pour avoir\nplus de chances d’obtenir un objet après l’avoir capturé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gibst du diese Beere einem Pokémon zu essen, wird die\nChance, bei einem erfolgreichen Fangversuch ein Item\nzu erhalten, erhöht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una baya que puedes lanzar a un Pokémon salvaje\npara aumentar bastante las probabilidades de conseguir\nun objeto tras capturarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bacca che rende più facile ottenere strumenti\nquando catturi il Pokémon a cui l’hai data.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Berry that makes you more likely to get an item when\ngiven to Pokémon you’re trying to catch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　あたえると\n捕まえた　ときに　道具が\n手にはいり　やすくなる　きのみ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果把这树果交给宝可梦，\n那么接下来捉住该宝可梦时，\n会更容易获得道具。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
